1593:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         sample and hold) and output buffer state.
1594:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         - if output connection is set to internal path and output buffer
1595:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *           is enabled (whatever output mode):
1596:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *           output connection is also connected to GPIO pin
1597:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *           (both connections to GPIO pin and internal path).
1598:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         - if output connection is set to GPIO pin, output buffer
1599:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *           is disabled, output mode set to sample and hold:
1600:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *           output connection is also connected to internal path
1601:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *           (both connections to GPIO pin and internal path).
1602:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @rmtoll CR       MODE1          LL_DAC_SetOutputConnection\n
1603:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         CR       MODE2          LL_DAC_SetOutputConnection
1604:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @param  DACx DAC instance
