1791:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @brief  Set the signed format for the selected DAC channel.
1792:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @note   On this SR5E1 series, signed format can be used to inject
1793:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         Q1.15, Q1.11, Q1.7 signed format data to DAC.
1794:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         Ex when using 12bits data format (Q1.11 is used):
1795:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *             0x800 will output 0v level
1796:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *             0xFFF will output mid-scale level
1797:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *             0x000 will output mid-scale level
1798:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *             0x7FF will output full-scale level
1799:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @rmtoll MCR      SINFORMAT1     LL_DAC_SetSignedFormat\n
