1896:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         CR       DMAEN2         LL_DAC_IsDMAReqEnabled
1897:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @param  DACx DAC instance
1898:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   * @param  DAC_Channel This parameter can be one of the following values:
1899:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_DAC_CHANNEL_1
1900:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_DAC_CHANNEL_2 (1)
1901:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *
1902:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.h ****   *         (1) On this SR5E1 series, parameter not available on all instances.
