 226:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   * @brief  Initialize some features of DAC channel.
 227:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   * @note   @ref LL_DAC_Init() aims to ease basic configuration of a DAC channel.
 228:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *         Leaving it ready to be enabled and output:
 229:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *         a level by calling one of
 230:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *           @ref LL_DAC_ConvertData12RightAligned
 231:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *           @ref LL_DAC_ConvertData12LeftAligned
 232:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *           @ref LL_DAC_ConvertData8RightAligned
 233:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *         or one of the supported autogenerated wave.
 234:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   * @note   This function allows configuration of:
 235:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *          - Output mode
 236:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *          - Trigger
 237:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *          - Wave generation
 238:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_DAC_Init()
 239:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *         is conditioned to DAC state:
 240:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   *         DAC channel must be disabled.
 241:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   * @param  DACx DAC instance
 242:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_dac.c ****   * @param  DAC_Channel This parameter can be one of the following values:
